Package: presizepo
Title: Precision-Based Sample Size for Proportional Odds Models
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("André", "Moser", email = "andre.moser@unibe.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Precision-based (CI-width) sample size and standard error
    calculations for the log odds ratio in a proportional-odds (ordinal
    logistic regression) model, for either a binary group predictor or a
    continuous predictor. Two approaches are supported: Whitehead's (1993)
    delta-method variance approximation, and the exact weighted
    proportional-odds MLE fit of White, Marley-Zagar, Morris, Parmar,
    Royston & Babiker (2023) <doi:10.1177/1536867X231162228>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
